{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-1","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · DSH Desk Pet：<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"README_EN.md\">English</a> · <b>简体中文</b></p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <b>一只跟着你的 agent 换表情的 macOS 桌宠。<br>\n  换成你自己的猫也行。</b>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/media/diy-skin.png\" width=\"820\" alt=\"一张猫的照片变成六个状态的桌宠\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <sub>进去一张照片，出来六个状态：空闲、干活、等你、报错、开心、睡着。<br>\n  生图跑的是你自己的工具、烧的是你自己的额度，我这边不往任何地方传东西。</sub>\n</p>","source":"extracted","section":"DSH Desk Pet"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-2","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · DSH Desk Pet：<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/macOS-only-000000.svg?logo=apple&logoColor=white\" alt=\"macOS only\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/deepseek-desk-pet\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/npm/v/deepseek-desk-pet.svg?color=cb3837&label=npm\" alt=\"npm\"></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-blue.svg\" alt=\"License\"></a>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/python-系统自带-3776AB.svg\" alt=\"System Python\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/依赖-零-2ea44f.svg\" alt=\"No dependencies\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/topics/dsh-plugin\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/topic-dsh--plugin-111111.svg\" alt=\"dsh-plugin\"></a>\n</p>","source":"extracted","section":"DSH Desk Pet"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-3","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · DSH Desk Pet：<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/media/floats-above.png\" width=\"820\" alt=\"桌宠浮在一个全屏编辑器之上\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <sub>它是一个真的 macOS 窗口，不是塞进 DSH 页面里的挂件。<br>\n  盖在我正在用的一切上面，全屏也盖得住，不用我告诉它现在该显示什么。</sub>\n</p>\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"DSH Desk Pet"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-4","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 安装：已经有 DSH 的话，一条命令：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add deepseek-desk-pet\ndsh web\n```\n\n装完宠物就浮在桌面上了，DSH 页面本身不会被塞任何东西。\n\n从旧版本升级得带 `@latest`：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add deepseek-desk-pet@latest\n```\n\n不带的话写进去的是 `^0.x` 范围，而 caret 作用在 `0.x` 上会锁住次版本号，`^0.1.0` 永远不接受 `0.2.0`。裸命令会报一句 Already up to date，旧版本原地不动。\n\n不想装 DSH、只想看宠物：克隆下来跑 `./bin/dsh-desk-pet`。\n\n想跟 main 分支而不是发布版：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet#main\n```","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-5","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 安装：> 包名叫 **deepseek-desk-pet**，仓库叫 **dsh-desk-pet**。npm 认为 `dsh-desk-pet`\n> 和一个无关的 `dsh-deskpet` 太像，拒绝发布，所以两个名字不一致。\n\n**零依赖。** 装它不用先装别的东西，不用编译，也不需要 ffmpeg。跑的是系统自带的 python。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-6","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 使用：| | |\n|---|---|\n| **拖** | 按住身体任意处。放哪下次就从哪开始。 |\n| **点一下** | 展开会话清单：有哪些 DSH 会话、哪个还活着、各自在干什么。再点一下收起。 |\n| **免打扰** | 让它安静，直到你自己关掉。agent 照常干活，宠物不再反应。摸它还是会弹一下。 |\n| **右键** | 菜单：免打扰、会话清单、皮肤、宠物出现在哪、项目主页、检查更新、退出。 |\n| **停掉** | `./bin/dsh-desk-pet --stop`，或者直接停 `dsh web`。 |\n\n它是后台进程，启动之后就脱离终端了，所以开它的那个窗口可以直接关。","source":"extracted","section":"使用"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-7","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 状态：<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/media/states.png\" width=\"720\" alt=\"空闲、干活、等你、报错、开心、睡着\">\n</p>\n\n跟着本地 DSH 自动变，没有需要配的东西。\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> 空闲\n    空闲 --> 干活: DSH 开始跑\n    干活 --> 等你: 卡在确认或授权\n\n| 状态 | 什么时候 |\n| --- | --- |\n| **空闲** | 没事干，会呼吸、偶尔眨眼 |\n| **干活** | DSH 正在跑 |\n| **等你** | 卡在确认、授权、要你输入 |\n| **报错** | 跑挂了 |\n| **开心** | 刚跑完一轮，3.2 秒后自己回到空闲 |\n| **睡着** | agent 闲着**且**你的鼠标也不动了才打盹，一有动静或者你戳它就醒 |","source":"extracted","section":"状态"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-8","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 皮肤：<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/media/skins.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"五套皮肤\">\n</p>\n\n在右键菜单的皮肤子菜单里挑，或者用 `--skin <id>` 指定启动时用哪套。每套六个状态齐全，每个状态三帧。","source":"extracted","section":"皮肤"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-9","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 皮肤：| 皮肤 | 动起来 |\n|---|---|\n| **深索鲸（默认）** | <img src=\"docs/media/loop-deepseek.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"deepseek\"> |\n| **蓝鲸** | <img src=\"docs/media/loop-bluewhale.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"bluewhale\"> |\n| **线核** | <img src=\"docs/media/loop-threadcore.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"threadcore\"> |\n| **鹦鹉螺** | <img src=\"docs/media/loop-nautilus.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"nautilus\"> |\n| **水母** | <img src=\"docs/media/loop-jellyfish.gif\" width=\"120\" alt=\"jellyfish\"> |\n\n> 空闲是 2.4 秒静止，然后一次很短的眨眼。三帧均分我试过，效果不好。","source":"extracted","section":"皮肤"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-10","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 每套皮肤的六个状态：顺序：空闲 · 干活 · 等你 · 报错 · 开心 · 睡着\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/media/skin-deepseek.png\" width=\"820\" alt=\"deepseek\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>深索鲸（默认）</sub></p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/media/skin-bluewhale.png\" width=\"820\" alt=\"bluewhale\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>蓝鲸</sub></p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/media/skin-threadcore.png\" width=\"820\" alt=\"threadcore\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>线核</sub></p>","source":"extracted","section":"每套皮肤的六个状态"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-11","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 每套皮肤的六个状态：<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/media/skin-nautilus.png\" width=\"820\" alt=\"nautilus\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>鹦鹉螺</sub></p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/media/skin-jellyfish.png\" width=\"820\" alt=\"jellyfish\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>水母</sub></p>","source":"extracted","section":"每套皮肤的六个状态"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-12","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 用一张图做你自己的皮肤：把一张图交给你的 agent，让它做一套桌宠皮肤。插件里带了个 skill，负责把这张图扩写成一套皮肤要的十八个姿势，六个状态每个三帧。生图是你自己的工具在跑，烧的是你自己的额度，我这边不往任何地方发东西。做好的皮肤落在 `~/.dsh-desk-pet/skins/`，在安装包外面，所以升级插件不会把它删掉。\n\n十八张图烧的是真金白银，所以 skill 中途会停两次让你确认：第一张画出来先看角色对不对，第二张画出来再确认还是同一个角色。半路失败会告诉你缺哪几个，已经生出来的那些留着。\n\n做好之后可以拿出来给人看。一条命令把六个状态拼成一张图：\n\n```bash\n./bin/dsh-desk-pet --skin-sheet <你的皮肤id>\n```\n\n欢迎投进 [皮肤画廊](SKINS.md)，只交那一张预览图，帧素材留你自己机器上。","source":"extracted","section":"用一张图做你自己的皮肤"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-13","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 参数：```bash\n./bin/dsh-desk-pet --scale 0.5      # 更小（默认 0.7）\n./bin/dsh-desk-pet --skin jellyfish # 指定启动时的皮肤\n./bin/dsh-desk-pet --reset          # 忘掉存下来的位置、大小、皮肤\n./bin/dsh-desk-pet --stop           # 停掉正在跑的那只","source":"extracted","section":"参数"}
{"unit_id":"anneheartrecord__dsh-desk-pet#readme-14","repo":"anneheartrecord/dsh-desk-pet","commit":"18bfb38316e5e4fe64f3c1fa50c5dd520776cfae","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"deepseek-desk-pet README · 已知限制：- 宠物四周有一圈透明边距，点在那上面不会穿透到后面的窗口。\n- 这一版没有设置窗口，也没有贴边的 mini 模式。\n- 生成皮肤的时候这边不显示进度，那十八张图期间你只能看自己 agent 的输出。\n- 只支持 macOS。Windows 和 Linux 我没有机器测，短期也不打算做。\n\n它内部怎么跑的、以及我当时选错过哪几个地方，写在 [docs/INTERNALS.zh-CN.md](docs/INTERNALS.zh-CN.md)。\n\n后面想做什么、什么不打算做，写在 [docs/ROADMAP.md](docs/ROADMAP.md)。","source":"extracted","section":"已知限制"}
